// expect-error: undefined function 'p_remove': no runtime has a builtin of that name
// Bugs roadmap BG470: p_remove (named in reference §9.1's effect table) is
// in no runtime; before, `fid check` passed and `fid run` panicked
// "Unknown function 'p_remove'".
fn main() {
    p_file_write("bg470_rm_me.txt", "x");
    println(f"{p_remove("bg470_rm_me.txt")}");
}
